      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Idea is really good, but it shouldn't take precedence over the existing safety system. Indeed malicious avatars are very often uploaded on lower ranked accounts.\nSafety settings though are also used to block off non-malicious avatars, which often have music (sometimes playing with no spatial script), heavy animations etc.\nI notice these are more often misused by lower ranked players, because they often are not aware of what kind of impact their currently worn avatar has on others.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
