      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5dcae10f2fb049260da562f6|full_name}: I'm all for giving people more options, though at some point the UI/behavior might become too complex for an average user. If the team can make both current and suggested rank-based limits work together - that would be great, sure.",
      "viewerReactions": null
